{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-07T00:17:02.847Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"4d05e51e9085533fb7cd32a8","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-dg68kr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Packing ships only the declarations an exported types entry reaches, restoring the artifact headroom PR 1680 exhausted"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"PR 1680's Gates (static) failed the base package-artifact profile: unpacked_size 20,025,292 > 20,000,000 and file_count 1,801 > 1,800. The run is 42309984232. One new emitted module, close-fields-retry, exhausted the 20,892 B and one-file headroom recorded on pm-998juj. Measured composition: 685 packed dist declarations, of which 212 (266,135 B) are unreachable from every exported types entry. The exports map refuses unexported subpaths, so no consumer can import those declarations. They are the CLI internals behind ./cli (whose public.d.ts is self-contained), the MCP servers, dist/cli.d.ts, and internal SDK and core modules. All 1,695 relative specifiers in dist declarations are .js module paths, and none use triple-slash references."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:release","packaging","release-reliability"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-07T00:17:02.847Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-07T00:17:02.847Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The publication tree leaves out every dist .d.ts that no exported types entry reaches and keeps every reachable one; the checkout keeps all declarations; the closure walk refuses the pack when an exported or referenced declaration is missing from the packlist or a relative specifier is not a .js module path; the packed smoke's strict TypeScript consumer imports every exported types entry, and a removed reachable declaration fails that compile; base and Sentry-injected package-artifact profiles pass with ceilings unchanged; npx and bunx packed smoke stays green; docs/RELEASING.md records the decision"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-998juj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"d44b7051a7eb908e527d05ca019b2d542509c96bec5808cbc13fbab8d511a49f","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ebc1d6b2872921fda0f9ab585ce7c8d6d6f6d977ed84c2f0311be539eaf3e80f"}
