{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-07T00:55:24.703Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"4d05e51e9085533fb7cd32a8","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-dg68kr","lineage:pm-dg68kr","lineage:pm-998juj","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-dg68kr","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-dg68kr","lineage:pm-dg68kr","lineage:pm-998juj","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-07T00:55:24.703Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Correction found by the full suite, which Codex round 15 missed: the exports-map premise holds only when the manifest declares exports. tests/integration/registry-acceptance-workflow.spec.ts packs a reviewed-controls fixture whose manifest has no exports or types, and the first version pruned its required dist/sdk/index.d.ts (required_path_missing). Without an exports map every subpath stays deep-importable, so stageSourceFiles now prunes only when manifest.exports is defined. The fixture pack spec re-packs without exports and asserts that every declaration ships. docs/RELEASING.md states the rule. pm-cli's own manifest declares exports, so the measured savings are unchanged (gate: 19,760,781 B / 1,589 files)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-07T00:55:24.703Z"}],"before_hash":"1671bec306d5aa7495c46566d915b9461ddb8cd5bea39dc2e27d0aeaf55c430b","after_hash":"5f50f85285e4f89a638d6db4e608fd13c4ab1cc129479901bd3aa17f4c14cc5d","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_ou